# Generated protobuf stubs (src/gen/) ARE committed, despite being a build
# output: the vendored OpenShell proto source (_vendor/OpenShell) is
# deliberately kept out of this public repo (see .git/info/exclude), so
# without committing the stubs a fresh clone could never regenerate them
# and the service would not build. Regenerate locally with `npm run gen`
# if the upstream proto schema changes, and commit the result.
